# Static Linux — Sabor: Gaming
# Steam + Proton, Lutris, Heroic (Epic/GOG/Amazon), Minecraft, MangoHud, GameMode.
# Performance setup done by the installer (installer/calamares/modules/sabores):
# [multilib], 32-bit Vulkan driver for the detected GPU, user in the gamemode
# group, ntsync loaded (Wine/Proton sync without esync/fsync hacks).
# Verified against the official repos + Flathub 2026-10-23.
steam
lutris
gamemode
lib32-gamemode
mangohud
lib32-mangohud
gamescope
goverlay
vulkan-icd-loader
lib32-vulkan-icd-loader
lib32-mesa
wine
wine-mono
winetricks
protontricks
prismlauncher

